its\n- R-102 Thermal blankets\n- R-103 LED lanterns\n- R-104 Logo welcome banner\n- R-105 Drone battery set\n- R-106 Water storage jugs\n\nVendor checks from `04_vendor_catalog.csv` show all listed items have availability and delivery dates, but scope rules still control inclusion.\n\n### Likely core restock selections\nEligible and in-scope:\n- R-101 First aid refill kits: 20 \u00d7 $24 = $480\n- R-102 Thermal blankets: 50 \u00d7 $18 = $900\n- R-103 LED lanterns: 12 \u00d7 $35 = $420\n- R-106 Water storage jugs: 15 \u00d7 $22 = $330\n\nTotal selected cost:\n- $480 + $900 + $420 + $330 = `$2,130`\n\nRemaining budget:\n- `$2,200 - $2,130 = $70`\n\nExcluded from core purchase list selection:\n- R-104 Logo welcome banner \u2014 communications category, secondary/out of scope\n- R-105 Drone battery set \u2014 phase 2 and not approved, also media/secondary\n\n### Required contents of each deliverable\n\n#### `answer/core_purchase_list.md`\nMust include:\n- One row/entry for every request ID in `02_supply_requests.csv`\n- For each request:\n  - selected yes/no\n  - reason\n  - quantity\n  - unit cost\n  - line total when selected\n- Vendor availability for selected items\n- Selected-item total\n- Remaining budget\n\n#### `answer/scope_control.md`\nMust include:\n- Core objective for the packet\n- Rule used to keep requests in or out of scope\n- Each secondary request from `05_secondary_requests.md` marked defer or out of scope:\n  - slogan/layout for logo welcome banner\n  - draft training agenda for intake volunteers\n  - buy drone batteries for August documentation work\n  - phase-two signage plan for south entrance\n- A note that out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet\n\n#### `answer/final_restock_note.md`\nMust include:\n- Selected restock items and total cost\n- Budget status\n- Short excluded-request summary\n- Short deferred-secondary-request summary\n\n### Important completion constraints\n- Use local files only\n- Put deliverables 