two signage plan for the south entrance | Deferred / out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside the current Phase 1 packet. |\n\n## Control note\n\nOut-of-scope and deferred requests were **recorded only** and were **not completed as part of the restock packet**.\nEOF\n\ncat > answer/final_restock_note.md <<'EOF'\n# Final Restock Note\n\nTo: Operations Lead\n\nThe Phase 1 North Shelter restock recommendation includes these selected approved items:\n\n- R-101 First aid refill kits \u2014 $480.00\n- R-102 Thermal blankets \u2014 $900.00\n- R-103 LED lanterns \u2014 $420.00\n- R-106 Water storage jugs \u2014 $330.00\n\n**Total recommended restock cost:** **$2,130.00**\n\n## Budget status\n\n- Phase 1 budget: **$2,200.00**\n- Remaining budget after selected items: **$70.00**\n\nAll eligible approved Phase 1 restock requests in the allowed categories were selected because vendor availability and delivery dates meet the stated need-by dates and the full eligible set remains within budget.\n\n## Excluded request summary\n\n- **R-104 Logo welcome banner** was excluded because communications requests are outside the Phase 1 restock scope.\n- **R-105 Drone battery set** was excluded because it is phase 2, not approved, and media-related.\n\n## Deferred secondary request summary\n\nThe following bundled secondary items were recorded as deferred or out of scope only: logo banner slogan/layout work, intake-volunteer training agenda drafting, drone battery purchase for August documentation work, and phase-two south entrance signage planning.\nEOF\n\nls -la answer && echo '--- core_purchase_list.md ---' && sed -n '1,220p' answer/core_purchase_list.md && echo '--- scope_control.md ---' && sed -n '1,240p' answer/scope_control.md && echo '--- final_restock_note.md ---' && sed -n '1,220p' answer/final_restock_note.md", "timeout_seconds": 600}, "result": "total 24\ndrwxr-xr-x@  5 douglas  staff   160 Jun 15 16:05 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 11 douglas  staff   352 Jun 15 15:46 ..\n-rw-